OL,3,GNEWSATrial of Love Island contestant's 
OL,4,Afather adjourned                       
OL,6,FThe trial of former Love Island        
OL,7,Fcontestant Adam Collard's father, who  
OL,8,Fis accused of assaulting his son, has  
OL,9,Fbeen adjourned.                        
OL,11,FWilliam Collard was charged with       
OL,12,Fassault by beating following a dispute 
OL,13,Fover property in September 2025.       
OL,15,FThe 57-year-old, of Horsley,           
OL,16,FNorthumberland, appeared at Newcastle  
OL,17,FMagistrates' Court on Friday but was   
OL,18,Ftold the court did not have time to    
OL,19,Fhear his trial, which had three trials 
OL,20,Flisted for the same time that day. The 
OL,21,Fcase was adjourned to 4 February.      
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
